#8812
The Coast~
   You stand at the edge of the great forest, on the coast of an ocean
that stretches to the eastern horizon. Occasionally, you can hear and
see the eruption of water from a whale's blowhole.
   Water slaps against the rocks below you, drenching the mosses and
water-worn stones.
