The Coast~
   You stand at the edge of the great forest, on the coast of an ocean that
stretches to the eastern horizon. Otters swim along the tips of the coastal
grasses, chewing on fish and mussels.
   Water slaps against the rocks below you, drenching the mosses and
water-worn stones.
