#8823
A Canopied Cove~
   You stand beneath a tall pine tree where the coast meets this rocky cove.
Leafy branches float above the briny grasses and mats of brown pine needles,
forming an ideal nesting site for a family of sea ducks.
   The coast continues to the east and south, while the thick forest stretches
to the northwest.
~
