#8824
The Coast~
   You stand at the edge of the great forest, on the coast of the eastern
ocean that stretches to the horizon. Gulls and terns shriek overhead as
they vie with the forest jays for nesting space in the canopy of trees above.
   The wooded coast continues to the west, where it curves southward to form
a small cove.
~
